                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Telegram 3653, August 23, to London, <ref target="#pg1055">page 1055</ref>, set
                    forth the tentative views of the Department of State regarding a delay in the
                    resumption of reparations deliveries. General Clay’s comments were sent in telegram 72088, August 25, from
                    London, <ref target="#pg1059">page 1059</ref>.</p>
            </div>
